5000/260 as far as the LEDs are concerned -- besides, I don't have a
5000/240 guide to hand :-); Many 240s became 260s as they evolved
anyway, then the OSF-Damocleasian "there can only be one" decision
comet struck and the Mipsosaurus Ultrixian became extinct, unextinct,
extinct again, then unextinct, and finally snuffed for good in a
stirring DEC pants-at-half-mast farewell ceremony announcement].


