4000-60.  The SHOW DEVICE command erroneously reports their size (I
think it is modulo 8GB), but VMS doesn't have a problem.

Be aware that VMS 5.5-2 or earlier has a 8.something GB limit to the
file system.  To use one of theses disks with VMS 5.5-2 or earlier, you
need to use a driver that can partition the disks.

