I don't believe the above is correct.  The mechanism in use by the DECUS
Office here in Australia is as follows:

  - DECUS members who wish to obtain the OpenVMS Hobbyist licence package
    must contact the DECUS office (by whatever means they choose)

  - Once a month, the DECUS office sends the batch of requests to Compaq.

  - Compaq responds (fairly promptly) with the licence PAKs.

