If you are genuinely developing software for sale, join the Compaq Solutions
Alliance.  You get hefty discounts on new hardware and free licences for all
the software development tools you are likely to need.

To "use the box at work to run a simple database package" you would need a
database package.  There are *no* free database packages for OpenVMS (from
Compaq or anyone else) unless you consider RMS a database package.  You might
like to ask Oracle or
Intersystems about that.

BTW, VAX and older Alpha hardware is readily available from most Compaq
resellers.

