israel r t wrote:
> 
> One of the major advantages Unix has was that just about anyone who
> does computer science is exposed to Unix ( and often only to Unix )
> 
> However, I remember in the mid eighties, at the comp.sci dept my
> account was on a unix clone ( Apollo Domain ) while at the biomedical
