I have downloaded a developers version of Oracle under exactly those
terms.

Simple online registration ,took around 2 minutes. That  also gave me
membership in the "Oracle Education Student Union" with a variety of
educational materials. I also get a nice ( and not excessively hype
filled ) Oracle magazine for my pains.  ( It also looks nice in my
office waiting room ! )

