I believe part that may have been snipped from that same post may have
gone on to say the the idea of a filesystem "root" does not translate
directly to VMS. Essentially, each RVN-1 has an MFD (Master File
Directory) and each such MFD is a volume "root". 

So, the discussion is irrelevant, anyway.

